{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/0": "已经感觉不到石像的气息了……\r\n做出这个选择，\r\n真的没问题吗……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/455": "献祭康拉斯的D兵。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/712": "献祭宠物。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/956": "献祭凯顿。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/1204": "献祭Nami。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/1450": "献祭Cole。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/1696": "献祭Draco。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/1943": "献祭Merril。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/2192": "献祭Baldur。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/2441": "献祭Aerdou。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/2693": "献祭Coco与泥泥。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/2947": "献祭多西。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/3195": "献祭多西。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/3442": "献祭Olga。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/3500": "我不会做这种事。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/1": "看起来只是座石像，不过……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/2": "那到底是什么……\r\n我感觉到一股神秘……\r\n而又邪恶的力量。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/3": "带特定同伴前去时，\r\n似乎会发生些什么。\r\n你产生了这种感觉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/4": "从石像上感觉到一股\r\n无比邪恶的气息………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/5": "“…… …… …… …… …… …… …… 嘎”\r\n“………………是……么？”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/7": "咦？你听见什么了吗？\r\n我可什么都没听见哦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/8": "“你想要……力量吗？！”\r\n“呵呵呵，我就赐给你吧！”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/9": "“但你必须献上\r\n同伴的性命。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/10": "“若愿献上他们的性命，\r\n就说出一个词。\r\n仅凭那一句话，我便赐你‘力量’。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/11": "“呵呵！那么……\r\n你要怎么做？”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/12": "“原来如此……你为了拯救世界，\r\n若失败，就连一个同伴的性命\r\n也舍不得吗……”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/13": "“届时你将追悔莫及……”\r\n“为这里的选择……”\r\n“呵呵呵呵！”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/14": "“你的话，我确实听见了。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/15": "“那边的家伙……你的灵魂归我了。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/16": "“若你心生怨恨……\r\n就恨出卖你的那个人。”\r\n“恨\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]吧。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/17": "怎么会！\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/18": "………………………………\r\n（用毫无怀疑的目光\r\n注视着你）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/19": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！你、你是在开玩笑吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/20": "咦……\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人？\r\n……不会吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/21": "什……啊。\r\n看来我的死法……\r\n也就是这么回事了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/22": "叽？！\r\n叽啊啊啊啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/23": "这是……\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]……你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/24": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]……我绝不会原谅你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/25": "你这混蛋啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/26": "泥泥……我好害怕！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/27": "咦……不会吧，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人。\r\n你是在开玩笑……对吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/28": "咦……不会吧，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人。\r\n你是在开玩笑……对吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/29": "竟然会在这种地方……\r\n跟着你走到这一步，\r\n我也真是的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/30": "“相当令人满足的灵魂。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/31": "“那么，我便赐予你力量。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_74_cheated_altar_ev_talk.txt/32": "你的愿望已经实现了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_75_stove_ev_talk.txt/0": "是篝火……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_75_stove_ev_talk.txt/1": "身体暖和起来了。\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]恢复了精神！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_76_letter_signboard_ev_talk.txt/0": "这里有一封信。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_76_letter_signboard_ev_talk.txt/1": "旅人啊，这间小屋里的物资\r\n请随意使用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_76_letter_signboard_ev_talk.txt/2": "但作为代价……留下你的命来！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_76_letter_signboard_ev_talk.txt/3": "是陷阱！我们被埋伏了？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_78_stone_wall_ev_talk.txt/0": "这是……一堵石墙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_90_snow_rabbit_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_90_snow_rabbit_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>歪了歪头。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_91_otter_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_91_otter_ev_talk.txt/0": "（吱）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_91_otter_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n寻找可以游泳的地方。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_92_desert_fox_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_92_desert_fox_ev_find.txt/0": "汪呜 汪呜",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_92_desert_fox_ev_talk.txt/0": "（呜汪）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_92_desert_fox_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>睁着水汪汪的大眼睛\r\n叫了一声。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_93_goat_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_93_goat_ev_find.txt/0": "咩——",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_93_goat_ev_talk.txt/0": "咩啊啊啊～。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_93_goat_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>睡眼惺忪地\r\n叫了一声。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_94_white_horse_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_94_white_horse_ev_find.txt/0": "咴——",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_94_white_horse_ev_talk.txt/0": "咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_94_white_horse_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>精神十足地\r\n嘶鸣了一声。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_damage.txt/0": "唔……你这混蛋！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_find.txt/2": "你夺走了濒危生物的生命，\r\n这便是罪！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_find.txt/3": "就用死亡来偿还\r\n你的罪孽吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_talk.txt/0": "就用你的命来清算\r\n你的罪孽！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_talk.txt/1": "……有什么事吗？\r\n我是“森林防卫队”的\r\n队长。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_talk.txt/2": "制裁盗猎保护动物之人，\r\n正是我们的\r\n职责。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_97_gf_leader_ev_talk.txt/3": "……你没有猎杀过吧。\r\n不会再有\r\n下一次机会了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_damage.txt/0": "唔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_find.txt/0": "是旅行者啊……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_find.txt/2": "你！正在\r\n猎杀保护动物吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_find.txt/3": "就用你的命，\r\n偿还那些逝去动物的生命！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/0": "我绝不会放过你……！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是“森林防卫队”的\r\n团员。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/2": "制裁盗猎保护动物之人，\r\n正是“森林防卫队”的职责。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/3": "\\c[51]狐狸\\c[0]、\\c[51]水獭\\c[0]、\\c[51]白马\\c[0]、\r\n\\c[51]山羊\\c[0]、\\c[51]兔子\\c[0]，还有\\c[51]飞马\\c[0]，\r\n都是保护动物。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/4": "它们明明无害，\r\n却总有人为了丰厚经验和金钱\r\n不停盗猎。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/5": "你也是，若敢猎杀那些动物，\r\n我们绝不会放过你，明白吗？\r\n这一点务必记住……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_98_gf_member_ev_talk.txt/6": "……你没有伤害保护动物吧？\r\n要是做过的话……\r\n就没有下次了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_110_handmade_arrow.txt/0": "<PLAYER>制作了\r\n50支木箭！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_119_handmade_mine.txt/0": "<PLAYER>制造了1枚\r\n火焰地雷！敌人触发后，\r\n会对3x3范围造成爆炸伤害。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_121_semi2.txt/0": "<PLAYER>使用了分裂之影！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_136_mine.txt/0": "在脚下设置了火焰地雷！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_138_warp.txt/0": "<PLAYER>使用了影步！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_138_warp.txt/1": "但移动目标处被挡住了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_159_summon_trap.txt/0": "是陷阱！\r\n敌人被召唤出来了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_160_warp_trap.txt/0": "是陷阱！\r\n被传送走了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_161_temptation_trap.txt/0": "是陷阱！\r\n陷入了诱惑状态！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_164_melt.txt/0": "<TARGET>的“溶解液”！\r\n武器耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_164_melt.txt/1": "<TARGET>的“溶解液”！\r\n护甲耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_169_squirt_water.txt/0": "<TARGET>吐出了水！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/0": "即使从此再也无法穿上衣服，\r\n也已有这份觉悟……！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/1": "这意味着从此无法再\r\n生活在文明社会……！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/2": "即便如此，我也要\r\n继续守护这个世界……！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/3": "原始之神啊，此刻请将\r\n大自然原本的力量赐予我！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/4": "全裸术士！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/6": "已经无法回头了……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/7": "以再也无法穿上衣服为代价，\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了强大的力量！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_16_zenura.txt/8": "但头脑也变差了一些，\r\n还失去了部分魅力！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_171_enemy_control.txt/0": "<TARGET>成为了同伴！\r\n到死都会为你战斗！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_185_summon.txt/0": "\\c[2]使用了召唤术！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_185_summon.txt/1": "\\c[2]使用了吸引术！",
