  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_18_learn_force.txt/10": "<PLAYER>学会了\r\n\\c[1]鸟瞰魔法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_18_learn_force.txt/11": "<PLAYER>学会了\r\n\\c[1]透视魔法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_18_learn_force.txt/12": "因为学会了4种魔法，\r\n\\c[1]学习魔法\\c[0]之力已经失去了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/0": "想制作疗伤膏。\r\n但EN似乎不足……",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/1": "想制作疗伤膏。\r\n但疗伤草\r\n似乎不够。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/398": "制作_\\c[1]1\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤草x2]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/478": "制作_\\c[1]2\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤草x4]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/558": "制作_\\c[1]3\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤草x6]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/621": "还是算了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/2": "制作疗伤膏！\r\n要制作几个？（\\c[2]消耗10%EN\\c[0]）\r\n[材料：疗伤草 \\c[1]x$tmp2\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_197_heal_ampule_create.txt/4": "获得了“\\c[1]疗伤膏\\c[0]”\\c[1]x$tmp2\\c[0]！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/0": "想制作疗伤药瓶。\r\n但EN似乎不足……",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/1": "想制作疗伤药瓶。\r\n但疗伤膏\r\n似乎不够。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/400": "制作_\\c[1]1\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤膏x2]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/481": "制作_\\c[1]2\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤膏x4]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/562": "制作_\\c[1]3\\c[0]_[消耗疗伤膏x6]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/626": "还是算了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/2": "制作疗伤药瓶！\r\n要制作几个？（\\c[2]消耗10%EN\\c[0]）\r\n[材料：疗伤膏 \\c[1]x$tmp2\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_198_big_heal_ampule_create.txt/4": "获得了“\\c[1]疗伤药瓶\\c[0]”\\c[1]x$tmp2\\c[0]！！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_208_mapping.txt/0": "探知下一座\\c[3]城镇\\c[0]。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_208_mapping.txt/44": "探知下一座\\c[3]地下城\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_208_mapping.txt/0": "<PLAYER>探明了下一座城镇的\r\n位置！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_208_mapping.txt/1": "<PLAYER>探明了下一座地下城的\r\n位置！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_233_first_aid.txt/0": "<PLAYER>为自己做了治疗。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_245_dimension_lord_skill.txt/0": "<TARGET>正\r\n观察着情况……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_245_dimension_lord_skill.txt/1": "\\c[2]<TARGET>召唤了\r\n灵魂！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_253_goddess_power.txt/0": "召唤了女神像！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_254_gravity_attack.txt/0": "<TARGET>吸收了\r\n\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]点最大WT！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_270_berserk_ampule.txt/0": "<TARGET>沐浴了\r\n狂战士之雾！\r\n力量不断涌出！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_271_reflesh_reaction.txt/0": "<TARGET>喝下了\r\n复元药瓶！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk.txt/0": "想找凯顿说话，可是\r\n他……他已经不在了……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk.txt/1": "<PLAYER>学会了\r\n\\c[1]友情合击\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/0": "凯顿，你平时会给传信渡鸦喂食吗？\r\n毕竟是搭档，\r\n你可真珍惜它。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/1": "这不是当然的吗？我和这小家伙……\r\n关系可不比你和\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]之间的羁绊逊色。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/2": "我已经走不了路，辞去了照料人的工作，\r\n那时它就是我和外界之间\r\n唯一的窗口。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/3": "哦，原来是这样……。\r\n好，小家伙，以后也请多关照。\r\n之前说了难听的话，抱歉哦——。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/4": "说起来，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]他们洗澡的时候，\r\n果然还是全都看到了吧？\r\n毕竟是一丝不挂嘛……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/5": "那当然看到了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/6": "你怎么能说得这么理直气壮！？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/7": "不看看的话，就发现不了伤口\r\n和身体不适的征兆吧？\r\n毕竟是照料他的人，理所当然。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/8": "而且，当时谁也没觉得不舒服。\r\n但如果有人不想被看，还硬要去看，\r\n那当然就是坏事。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/9": "不过，看别人大方展示的东西，\r\n可算不上什么坏事。\r\n当然，我也完全不介意。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/10": "我、我怎么开始头疼了……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/11": "喂，能问你一件事吗？\r\nNami以前是个怎样的人？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/12": "就像我之前说的，她有些胆小，\r\n动不动就觉得自己一无是处，\r\n却愿意为别人行动，是个温柔的家伙。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/13": "Nami、\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，还有我……\r\n那时候真开心啊。战争明明还在继续，\r\n但三个人在一起时，心情总能开朗起来。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/14": "原来如此，是很好的青梅竹马呢。\r\n听说\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]从前受过你们俩很多照顾。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/15": "唔，这次可能真有点不妙……。\r\n不过这一回，就算遍体鳞伤，\r\n我也会陪你走到最后。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/16": "和\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]一起踏上旅途，\r\n一路上与各种敌人战斗，想必也会经历许多痛苦吧。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/17": "原来如此，你也会想，说不定又会受伤，\r\n再也走不了路……。\r\n凯顿，你会害怕吗？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/18": "不，我还有点期待。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/19": "为什么！？\r\n啊啊，我居然还想过要怎么安慰你，\r\n哪怕只有一瞬，我真是个傻瓜！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_370_keyton_skilltalk_gossip.txt/20": "话说回来，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，\r\n你原本就是个出色的男人，\r\n如今更有男人味了。我为你骄傲。"
}
